 "name_en": "Invoice Correction Process with Credit Memo (BKL)",
 "description_en_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>Invoice Correction Process with Credit Memo (BKL)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loio6292fcf272ca4554ace913fd7c766e19\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio6292fcf272ca4554ace913fd7c766e19__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Overview</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">A credit memo request is created with the amount to be credited and placed on a billing block for review. The amount to be credited is calculated as the difference between the original amount and the correct amount entered manually in the credit memo request. It must then be released to become billing-relevant and to appear in the billing due list. The credit memo can be created manually. Alternatively, the periodic billing process automatically creates a credit memo to be sent to the customer and posts a journal entry.</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio6292fcf272ca4554ace913fd7c766e19__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Key Process Flow</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Create credit memo request</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Approve workflow for credit memo requests</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Remove billing block (review credit memo request)</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Create credit memo</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio6292fcf272ca4554ace913fd7c766e19__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Business Benefits</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Integrate credit memo processing in the system</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
 "description_zh_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>使用贷项凭证的发票更正流程 (BKL)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loio6292fcf272ca4554ace913fd7c766e19\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio6292fcf272ca4554ace913fd7c766e19__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">概览</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">创建含待贷记金额的贷项凭证请求，并置于开票冻结中以供检查。要贷记的金额计算为原始金额与在贷项凭证申请中手动输入的正确金额之间的差异。然后，必须将其审批以与开票相关并显示在开票到期清单中。可以手动创建贷项凭证。或者，定期开票流程会自动创建要发送给客户的贷项凭证并过账日记账分录。</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio6292fcf272ca4554ace913fd7c766e19__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">关键流程流</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">创建贷项凭证请求</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">审批贷项凭证请求的工作流</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">移除开票冻结（检查贷项凭证请求）</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">创建贷项凭证</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio6292fcf272ca4554ace913fd7c766e19__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">业务优势</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">在系统中集成贷项凭证处理</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
